    "text_421968903_copy_": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "user-1f15d09fdf@example.invalid",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-b3eaac8b1c@example.invalid",
      "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 06 2025 19:53:23 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\">Features and benefits</span></h2>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 14 2025 22:27:24 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
    "cols2_copy": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "user-b3eaac8b1c@example.invalid",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-b3eaac8b1c@example.invalid",
      "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 14 2025 20:21:50 GMT+0000",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 14 2025 20:21:50 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/columncontrol/cols2",
      "col1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "bottomPadding": "2",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-b3eaac8b1c@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-b3eaac8b1c@example.invalid",
          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Feb 11 2025 21:09:16 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Wet field characteristics</b></span></p>\n<p>HydroSet is formulated to harden in the presence of water, blood, and CSF, which allows for irrigation/ wash out of the surgery site during setting.<sup>2,3</sup><br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Mar 05 2025 17:27:03 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "text_copy_578833878_": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-b3eaac8b1c@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-b3eaac8b1c@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Feb 11 2025 21:09:16 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Osteoconductive</b></span></p>\n<p>HydroSet is a calcium phosphate cement that hardens to form hydroxyapatite and remodels to natural bone through osteoclastic resorption&nbsp;and new bone formation.<sup>1</sup></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Mar 05 2025 17:27:41 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "bottomPadding": "2",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-b3eaac8b1c@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-b3eaac8b1c@example.invalid",
          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Feb 11 2025 21:09:16 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Fast setting</b></span></p>\n<p>HydroSet has been specifically designed to set quickly once implanted under normal physiological conditions, potentially minimizing procedure time.<sup>1</sup></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Mar 05 2025 17:27:29 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "text_copy_578833878": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-b3eaac8b1c@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-b3eaac8b1c@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Feb 11 2025 21:09:16 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Isothermic</b></span></p>\n<p>HydroSet avoids thermal injury as it does not&nbsp;give off any potentially damaging heat as it hardens.<sup>1</sup></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Mar 05 2025 17:27:54 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
